   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "baking.ctx10"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Oh no. Two rescue ideas. A no bake cheesecake you can set in the fridge, or ask a neighbour if you can borrow their oven. Which feels doable?",
